WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:03.230
[music]

2
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:08.190
[Instructor] Cool, so
we've chosen a Background

3
00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:10.480
for our Project. So, we're good
to get started.

4
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.630
Now, we give the scene
a little bit of life,

5
00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.948
so we're going to add a Character
for the Player to control.

6
00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:19.339
So, in our Course Library,
we have our Characters,

7
00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:21.940
and we have the choice
between Farm or Town,

8
00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:24.530
so I'm just going to go
with Farm characters

9
00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:28.714
and... I'll just...
I think that one looks good.

10
00:00:28.714 --> 00:00:31.641
So, we're just going to drag
that into our Hierarchy. Cool!

11
00:00:31.943 --> 00:00:34.800
So, now what we're
going to do is, we're going

12
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.880
to rename this to our "Player,"
just like we did

13
00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.920
with some of our other players.

14
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.570
And our farmer is kinda
facing towards the back

15
00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:46.050
and that's not what we want
to do at all.

16
00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:48.484
So, if we just turn the farmer,

17
00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:51.485
let's just say like 90 degrees,
and that looks like...

18
00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.402
the farmer is facing forward.

19
00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:58.130
Cool. Perfect! Awesome!

20
00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:00.990
Now, one of the things
that I'm going to do just

21
00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:03.890
because I know
I'm going to need these later is,

22
00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:07.120
I'm actually just going to add
a Rigidbody Component now...

23
00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:16.110
And then I'm also going
to add a Box Collider...

24
00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:24.733
And, let's see where that Box
Collider is. It's very small.

25
00:01:24.733 --> 00:01:27.410
It's on the character's feet,

26
00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:29.410
which is definitely not
where we want that to be.

27
00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:32.721
So, let's bring 
that up to about the center

28
00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:37.699
and then we'll make that a little bit
larger,

29
00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:40.300
make the Z a little bit larger

30
00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:44.030
and then we'll just make sure
that the Y is properly set up. Cool!

31
00:01:45.003 --> 00:01:47.050
Looks just about right.

32
00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:52.010
Okay! Awesome!

33
00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:56.601
So, now that we have our Box Collider
set up on our Player,

34
00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:00.400
one of the things
that we're going to do is,

35
00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:03.370
create another Scripts Folder
by right-clicking on Assets,

36
00:02:08.530 --> 00:02:10.950
and we're going to need
a PlayerController Script

37
00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:13.018
to actually move our Player.

38
00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:20.116
And then we'll just make sure
that we attach

39
00:02:20.116 --> 00:02:22.210
our PlayerController Script
to our Player.

40
00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:27.120
Click on the Player Controller (Script),
and make sure it's there. Perfect!

41
00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:29.240
So, now what you're going to do is,

42
00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:31.240
you're going to select
your own Character

43
00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:34.530
and add them to the scene
through the Hierarchy,

44
00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:36.331
that way they are at, 0, 0, 0.

45
00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:41.050
You're going to rotate
your character on the Y-Axis,

46
00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:43.720
so then, that way,
they are facing in the direction

47
00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:45.720
that we want them to.

48
00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:48.660
Make sure you rename
your player character.

49
00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:51.890
Add a Rigidbody to the player

50
00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:54.226
and we're going to keep Gravity on.

51
00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:56.650
Add a Box Collider,
and just make sure

52
00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:59.177
that the Box Collider fits
within the character.

53
00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:03.920
And then you're going to make
a Scripts Folder in Assets

54
00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:06.100
and Create your own
PlayerController Script.

55
00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:09.893
So, now it's your turn.

56
00:03:10.123 --> 00:03:12.460
[music]
